ternal audits by a Big 4 Accounting firm to verify their contents. Additionally, Dinari employs a legal wrapper to shield the assets from potential claims in case of bankruptcy, ensuring allocation to token holders. Dinari also conducts regular smart contract audits to mitigate technical risks.\r\n\r\nFor a detailed breakdown of asset holdings, users can visit Dinari's transparency page at [https://www.dinari.com/transparency](https://www.dinari.com/transparency).\r\n\r\nDinari dShare assets can be minted and burned in the Dinari dApp at sbt.dinari.com. As ERC-20 tokens, dShares are theoretically in DeFi protocols such as DEXs, AMMs, etc.","slug":"dinari-brk-a","logo":"https://s2.coinmarketcap.com/static/img/coins/64x64/28630.png","subreddit":"dinari","notice":"","tags":["defi","tokenized-stock","arbitrum-ecosystem","tokenized-assets"],"tag-names":["DeFi","Tokenized Stock","Arbitrum Ecosystem","Tokenized Assets"],"tag-groups":["CATEGORY","CATEGORY","PLATFORM","CATEGORY"],"urls":{"website":["https://www.dinari.com/","https://sbt.dinari.com/"],"twitter":["https://twitter.com/DinariGlobal"],"message_board":["https://www.dinari.com/blog"],"chat":["https://discord.gg/dinari","https://t.me/dinariglobal"],"facebook":[],"explorer":["https://arbiscan.io/token/0x9dA913f4DCa9B210a232d588113047685a4ed4B1"],"reddit":["https://reddit.com/r/dinari"],"technical_doc":["https://github.com/dinaricrypto/sbt-contracts"],"source_code":["https://github.com/dinaricrypto/sbt-contracts"],"announcement":[]},"platform":{"id":"11841","name":"Arbitrum","symbol":"ARB","slug":"arbitrum","token_address":"0x9dA913f4DCa9B210a232d588113047685a4ed4B1"},"date_added":"2023-12-07T11:19:31.000Z","twitter_username":"DinariGlobal","is_hidden":0,"date_launched":"2021-10-31T00:00:00.000Z","contract_address":[{"contract_address":"0x9dA913f4DCa9B210a232d588113047685a4ed4B1","platform":{"name":"Arbitrum","coin":{"id":"11841","name":"Arbitrum","symbol":"ARB","slug":"arbitrum"}}}],"infinite_supply":false},"37020":{